  "notes": "Cash basis county. Governmental lines from the Statement of Receipts, Disbursements and Changes in Fund Balances (p4), Total Governmental Funds column. Taxes 4,568,152 split exactly using the Statement of Activities (p2): Property 4,143,258 + Motor vehicle 412,162 + Lodging 12,732. Sale of assets 10,000 in other_financing. Fund balance reclassification (Note 9) nets to 0 in the total column. Balance sheet from the governmental funds statement (p3), which equals the Statement of Net Position (p1). Detail: General Fund budget schedule (p8, departments not itemized), Inheritance Tax Fund column of the General Fund combining statement (p5), Road and Building Fund budget schedules (pp9-10), and Non-Major combining statement Total column (pp6-7, 11 funds). General Fund and Building Fund taxes stay unlabeled (cannot separate property and motor vehicle by fund). No business-type funds. Read pages 1-10 of 10."
